# Licensing

CopycatKiller uses different licenses for software and content.

## Software

Unless a source-code file states otherwise, software source code in this repository is licensed under the **Apache License, Version 2.0**.

Official license text:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

SPDX identifier: `Apache-2.0`

## Content and documentation

Unless a file states otherwise, the following materials are licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)**:

- `SKILL.md`
- `README.md`
- `examples/`
- other prose documentation and method descriptions

Canonical license page:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Legal code:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

SPDX identifier: `CC-BY-4.0`

## Attribution

For reused or adapted content, an attribution in the following form is recommended:

`CopycatKiller by Tenlossiby — https://github.com/Tenlossiby/CopycatKiller — CC BY 4.0`

Indicate if you modified the material. License terms govern where this summary differs from the official legal text.
